          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "поправляться (popravlyátsya) is the reflexive of поправлять, the partner of поправить 'to set right', built on править 'to put right' and правый 'right', which EtymDB traces to Proto-Slavic pravъ 'right, correct'."
